  <!-- EN: [elderbeast_label] is approaching the colony — it appears extremely dangerous, but not aggressive… for now. You must decide how to respond:\n\n-leave it alone;\n-attempt to tame it;\n-hunt it for rare and valuable trophies. -->
  <OE_Quest_ElderBeast.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.PawnsArrive.customLetterText.slateRef>[elderbeast_label]正在接近殖民地——它看起来极其危险，但暂时不具攻击性。你必须决定如何应对：\n\n-置之不理；\n-尝试驯服它；\n-猎杀它以获得稀有而珍贵的战利品。</OE_Quest_ElderBeast.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.PawnsArrive.customLetterText.slateRef>
